---

---

<section class="section-pricing">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center header">
            <span class="badge">PRICING</span>
            <h2>합리적인 투자로 시작하세요</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="pricing-grid">
            <!-- BASIC -->
            <div class="plan basic">
                <div class="plan-header">
                    <h3>BASIC</h3>
                    <div class="price">
                        500,000<span class="unit">원 / 월</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <ul class="features">
                    <li>전담 마케터 배정</li>
                    <li>기초 상권/경쟁사 분석</li>
                    <li>플랫폼 기본 세팅</li>
                    <li>월간 리포트 제공</li>
                </ul>
                <a
                    href="https://pf.kakao.com/PLACEHOLDER"
                    class="btn btn-outline">상담하기</a
                >
            </div>

            <!-- STANDARD -->
            <div class="plan standard">
                <div class="recommend-badge">권장</div>
                <div class="plan-header">
                    <h3>STANDARD</h3>
                    <div class="price">
                        1,200,000<span class="unit">원 / 월</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <ul class="features">
                    <li class="strong">BASIC 혜택 포함</li>
                    <li>인플루언서 섭외 지원</li>
                    <li>맞춤형 기획 콘텐츠 제작</li>
                    <li>리뷰/댓글 집중 관리</li>
                </ul>
                <a
                    href="https://pf.kakao.com/PLACEHOLDER"
                    class="btn btn-primary">지금 시작하기</a
                >
            </div>

            <!-- PRO -->
            <div class="plan pro">
                <div class="plan-header">
                    <h3>PRO</h3>
                    <div class="price">별도 협의<span class="unit"></span></div>
                </div>
                <ul class="features">
                    <li class="strong">STANDARD 혜택 포함</li>
                    <li>대규모 인플루언서 캠페인</li>
                    <li>영상 콘텐츠 제작 지원</li>
                    <li>프리미엄 1:1 컨설팅</li>
                </ul>
                <a
                    href="https://pf.kakao.com/PLACEHOLDER"
                    class="btn btn-outline">문의하기</a
                >
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .section-pricing {
        background: #f8f9fa;
    }

    .header {
        margin-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 6px 16px;
        background: #e9ecef;
        color: #495057;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        border-radius: 100px;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }

    h2 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .pricing-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 2rem;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .plan {
        background: white;
        padding: 2.5rem;
        border-radius: 20px;
        border: 1px solid #eee;
        text-align: center;
        position: relative;
        transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }

    .plan:hover {
        transform: translateY(-5px);
    }

    .plan.standard {
        border-color: var(--color-accent);
        box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08); /* Highlighted plan */
        transform: scale(1.05);
        z-index: 2;
    }
    .plan.standard:hover {
        transform: scale(1.05) translateY(-5px);
    }

    .recommend-badge {
        position: absolute;
        top: -12px;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        background: var(--color-accent);
        color: black;
        padding: 4px 12px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .plan-header {
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
        padding-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    h3 {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--color-text-sub);
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .price {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--color-text-main);
    }

    .unit {
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 400;
        color: var(--color-text-sub);
        margin-left: 4px;
    }

    .features {
        text-align: left;
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .features li {
        margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
        padding-left: 1.5rem;
        position: relative;
        color: var(--color-text-sub);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .features li::before {
        content: "✓";
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        color: var(--color-accent);
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    .features li.strong {
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--color-text-main);
    }

    .btn {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        padding: 1rem;
        border-radius: 10px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .btn-outline {
        border: 1px solid #ddd;
        color: var(--color-text-main);
    }
    .btn-outline:hover {
        background: #f8f9fa;
        border-color: #ccc;
    }

    .btn-primary {
        background: var(--color-accent);
        color: #111;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255, 192, 0, 0.3);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover {
        background: var(--color-accent-hover);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .pricing-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 3rem;
        }
        .plan.standard {
            transform: scale(1);
        }
        .plan.standard:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }
    }
</style>
